BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:neofreebird-7.2.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20261016T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261016
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261017
SUMMARY:NeoFreeBird v7.2.0
DESCRIPTION:Twitter 7.2.0 | NeoFreeBird-sideloaded-Twitter_7.2.0_12.33\n\n#
  Version 7.2.0\n\n## New Features\n- Added an option to choose the default
  reply sort\n- Updated X to 12.33\n- Added an option to hide retweets and 
 quotes from the “For You” page\n- Added option to convert [t.co](http:
 //t.co/) links and remove link tracking by @PEEKPerformer in https://githu
 b.com/NeoFreeBird/app/pull/135\n- Updated NFB settings to use the new sett
 ings design. You now hold the bird (or X) on the For You page to access NF
 B settings\n- Brought back the Tweet source labels!\n- Removed the “Mone
 y” tab\n- Enabling the option to hide views now also hides it in the twe
 et footer.\n\n## Fixes\n- Fixed more webview issues\n- NeoFreeBird now mor
 e reliably filters out video ads\n- Fixed hiding both the “Follow” and
  “Message” button on tweets by @sekiranunn in https://github.com/NeoFr
 eeBird/app/pull/140\n- Tweaked the wording of the “Reply in web view” 
 option to highlight it’s a fallback by @PEEKPerformer in https://github.
 com/NeoFreeBird/app/pull/138\n- Added localization support for the “Show
  quote numbers option”\n- Fixed the app crashing when adding more than 1
  account\n\n## Localizations\n* Update Japanese localization for in-app br
 owser text by @so-5699 in https://github.com/NeoFreeBird/app/pull/130\n* U
 pdate French localization by @jleroy in https://github.com/NeoFreeBird/app
 /pull/132\n* Update Japanese localization for reply sorting options by @so
 -5699 in https://github.com/NeoFreeBird/app/pull/136\n* Update Arabic loca
 lization by @ipapplus in https://github.com/NeoFreeBird/app/pull/139\n* Up
 date Turkish localization by @Huseyin-Korkmaz in https://github.com/NeoFre
 eBird/app/pull/142\n\n## New Contributors\n* @so-5699 made their first con
 tribution in https://github.com/NeoFreeBird/app/pull/130\n* @jleroy made t
 heir first contribution in https://github.com/NeoFreeBird/app/pull/132\n* 
 @PEEKPerformer made their first contribution in https://github.com/NeoFree
 Bird/app/pull/135\n* @ipapplus made their first contribution in https://
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/neofreebird.json
END:VEVENT
